---
layout: base.njk
title: "1 Rep Max Calculator: Estimate Your 1RM for Any Lift"
description: "Free 1 rep max calculator for squat, bench, deadlift and power clean. Get your estimated 1RM, a training percentage chart and your strength level for your bodyweight."
canonicalPath: "/one-rep-max-calculator"
mailerlite: true
pageStyle: |-
  <style>
    *, *::before, *::after { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
  
    :root {
      --bg: #080c10;
      --surface: #0f1419;
      --surface2: #161c24;
      --border: #1e2832;
      --accent: #aaff00;
      --accent-dim: rgba(170,255,0,0.12);
      --accent-glow: rgba(170,255,0,0.35);
      --text: #e8edf2;
      --text-muted: #5a6470;
      --text-mid: #8a96a4;
      --red: #ff4d4d;
      --orange: #ff9000;
      --yellow: #ffd600;
      --green: #aaff00;
      --blue: #00cfff;
      --font-display: 'Barlow Condensed', sans-serif;
      --font-body: 'DM Sans', sans-serif;
      --font-mono: 'DM Mono', monospace;
    }
  
    html { scroll-behavior: smooth; }
  
    body {
      background: var(--bg);
      color: var(--text);
      font-family: var(--font-body);
      min-height: 100vh;
      line-height: 1.5;
      overflow-x: hidden;
    }
  
    header {
      padding: 2rem 1.5rem 0;
      text-align: center;
    }
  
    .eyebrow {
      font-family: var(--font-mono);
      font-size: 0.7rem;
      letter-spacing: 0.18em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: var(--accent);
      margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
    }
  
    h1 {
      font-family: var(--font-display);
      font-size: clamp(2.8rem, 8vw, 5.5rem);
      font-weight: 900;
      line-height: 0.95;
      letter-spacing: -0.01em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: var(--text);
    }
  
    h1 span { color: var(--accent); display: block; }
  
    .subtitle {
      font-size: 0.95rem;
      color: var(--text-mid);
      margin-top: 1rem;
      max-width: 500px;
      margin-left: auto;
      margin-right: auto;
    }
  
    .container {
      max-width: 780px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding: 2.5rem 1.25rem 4rem;
    }
  
    .site-link {
      display: block;
      text-align: center;
      padding: 0.75rem 1rem;
      margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
      background: var(--surface);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 12px;
      color: var(--text-mid);
      text-decoration: none;
      font-size: 0.82rem;
      transition: border-color 0.2s, color 0.2s;
    }
  
    .site-link:hover { border-color: var(--accent); color: var(--accent); }
    .site-link strong { color: var(--accent); }
  
    .links-row {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
      gap: 0.75rem;
      margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    }
  
    @media (max-width: 500px) { .links-row { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }
  
    .card {
      background: var(--surface);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 16px;
      padding: 2rem;
      margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    }
  
    .card-label {
      font-family: var(--font-mono);
      font-size: 0.65rem;
      letter-spacing: 0.14em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: var(--text-muted);
      margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
    }
  
    .format-tabs {
      display: flex;
      background: var(--surface2);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 12px;
      padding: 4px;
      gap: 4px;
      margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
    }
  
    .format-tab {
      flex: 1;
      padding: 0.55rem 0.5rem;
      text-align: center;
      border-radius: 9px;
      cursor: pointer;
      border: none;
      background: transparent;
      color: var(--text-muted);
      font-family: var(--font-mono);
      font-size: 0.65rem;
      letter-spacing: 0.08em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      transition: all 0.15s;
    }
  
    .format-tab.active { background: var(--accent); color: #000; font-weight: 700; }
  
    .form-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
      gap: 1rem;
    }
  
    @media (max-width: 520px) { .form-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }
  
    .field label {
      display: block;
      font-size: 0.78rem;
      font-weight: 500;
      color: var(--text-mid);
      margin-bottom: 0.4rem;
      letter-spacing: 0.02em;
    }
  
    .field select,
    .field input {
      width: 100%;
      background: var(--surface2);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 10px;
      color: var(--text);
      font-family: var(--font-body);
      font-size: 1rem;
      padding: 0.75rem 1rem;
      appearance: none;
      outline: none;
      transition: border-color 0.2s;
    }
  
    .field select:focus,
    .field input:focus {
      border-color: var(--accent);
      box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px var(--accent-dim);
    }
  
    .full { grid-column: 1 / -1; }
  
    .calc-btn {
      width: 100%;
      margin-top: 1.25rem;
      padding: 1rem;
      background: var(--accent);
      color: #000;
      border: none;
      border-radius: 12px;
      font-family: var(--font-display);
      font-size: 1.2rem;
      font-weight: 800;
      letter-spacing: 0.08em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      cursor: pointer;
      transition: opacity 0.15s, transform 0.1s;
    }
  
    .calc-btn:hover { opacity: 0.88; }
    .calc-btn:active { transform: scale(0.98); }
  
    #results { display: none; }
    #results.visible { display: block; }
  
    .gauge-card {
      background: var(--surface);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 16px;
      padding: 2.5rem 2rem;
      text-align: center;
      margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
      position: relative;
      overflow: hidden;
    }
  
    .gauge-card::before {
      content: '';
      position: absolute;
      top: -60px; left: 50%;
      transform: translateX(-50%);
      width: 320px; height: 320px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      background: radial-gradient(circle, var(--accent-dim) 0%, transparent 70%);
      pointer-events: none;
    }
  
    /* Speed conversions strip */
    .conversions-row {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: center;
      gap: 1.5rem;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      margin-bottom: 1.75rem;
      padding-bottom: 1.75rem;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
    }
  
    .conv-item { text-align: center; }
  
    .conv-val {
      font-family: var(--font-display);
      font-size: 1.55rem;
      font-weight: 800;
      line-height: 1;
      color: var(--accent);
      transition: color 0.5s;
    }
  
    .conv-label {
      font-family: var(--font-mono);
      font-size: 0.58rem;
      letter-spacing: 0.12em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: var(--text-muted);
      margin-top: 0.2rem;
    }
  
    .gauge-svg {
      width: 100%;
      height: auto;
      overflow: visible;
    }
  
    .gauge-track {
      fill: none;
      stroke: var(--surface2);
      stroke-width: 18;
      stroke-linecap: round;
    }
  
    .gauge-fill {
      fill: none;
      stroke-width: 18;
      stroke-linecap: round;
      transition: stroke-dashoffset 1.2s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1), stroke 0.6s ease;
    }
  
    .verdict {
      font-family: var(--font-display);
      font-size: clamp(1.6rem, 5vw, 2.4rem);
      font-weight: 800;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.04em;
      margin-bottom: 0.4rem;
    }
  
    .verdict-sub { font-size: 0.9rem; color: var(--text-mid); }
  
    .compare-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
      gap: 0.75rem;
      margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    }
  
    @media (max-width: 480px) { .compare-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }
  
    .compare-card {
      background: var(--surface);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 12px;
      padding: 1.25rem;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 1rem;
    }
  
    .compare-icon {
      width: 42px; height: 42px;
      border-radius: 10px;
      display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
      font-size: 1.3rem;
      flex-shrink: 0;
    }
  
    .compare-text { flex: 1; min-width: 0; }
    .compare-title { font-size: 0.78rem; color: var(--text-muted); font-weight: 500; margin-bottom: 0.2rem; }
    .compare-val { font-family: var(--font-display); font-size: 1.25rem; font-weight: 800; line-height: 1.1; }
    .compare-avg { font-size: 0.68rem; color: var(--text-muted); font-family: var(--font-mono); margin-top: 0.15rem; }
  
    .badge {
      font-family: var(--font-mono);
      font-size: 0.6rem;
      letter-spacing: 0.1em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      padding: 0.2rem 0.5rem;
      border-radius: 100px;
      font-weight: 500;
    }
  
    .badge-above { background: rgba(170,255,0,0.15); color: var(--accent); }
    .badge-at    { background: rgba(255,214,0,0.15); color: var(--yellow); }
    .badge-below { background: rgba(255,77,77,0.12); color: var(--red); }
  
    .bar-card {
      background: var(--surface);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 16px;
      padding: 1.75rem 2rem;
      margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    }
  
    .bar-card-title {
      font-family: var(--font-display);
      font-size: 1.1rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.06em;
      margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
    }
  
    .bar-row {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 0.75rem;
      margin-bottom: 0.9rem;
    }
  
    .bar-label { font-size: 0.75rem; color: var(--text-mid); width: 115px; flex-shrink: 0; }
  
    .bar-track {
      flex: 1;
      height: 8px;
      background: var(--surface2);
      border-radius: 100px;
      overflow: hidden;
      position: relative;
    }
  
    .bar-fill {
      height: 100%;
      border-radius: 100px;
      transition: width 1s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1);
    }
  
    .bar-you-marker {
      position: absolute;
      top: -3px;
      width: 14px; height: 14px;
      background: var(--accent);
      border-radius: 50%;
      transform: translateX(-50%);
      box-shadow: 0 0 8px var(--accent-glow);
      transition: left 1s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1);
    }
  
    .bar-val { font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 0.72rem; color: var(--text-mid); width: 58px; text-align: right; flex-shrink: 0; }
  
    .scale-strip {
      display: flex;
      border-radius: 8px;
      overflow: hidden;
      height: 10px;
      margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
    }
  
    .scale-strip div { flex: 1; }
  
    .scale-labels {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      font-family: var(--font-mono);
      font-size: 0.6rem;
      color: var(--text-muted);
      margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
    }
  
    .info-card {
      background: var(--accent-dim);
      border: 1px solid rgba(170,255,0,0.2);
      border-radius: 12px;
      padding: 1.25rem 1.5rem;
      display: flex;
      gap: 1rem;
      align-items: flex-start;
      margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    }
  
    .info-icon { font-size: 1.2rem; flex-shrink: 0; margin-top: 0.1rem; }
    .info-text { font-size: 0.85rem; color: var(--text-mid); line-height: 1.6; }
    .info-text strong { color: var(--accent); }
  
    footer {
      text-align: center;
      padding: 2rem 1.5rem;
      font-size: 0.75rem;
      color: var(--text-muted);
      border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
      line-height: 1.8;
    }
  
    footer a { color: var(--text-muted); text-decoration: none; }
    footer a:hover { color: var(--accent); }
  
    @keyframes fadeUp {
      from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(18px); }
      to   { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
    }
  
    .anim { animation: fadeUp 0.5s ease both; }
    .anim-d1 { animation-delay: 0.05s; }
    .anim-d2 { animation-delay: 0.15s; }
    .anim-d3 { animation-delay: 0.25s; }
    .anim-d4 { animation-delay: 0.35s; }
  
    .you-row .bar-fill { background: var(--accent); }
    .you-row .bar-label { color: var(--accent); font-weight: 600; }
  
    /* ── ARTICLE SECTION ── */
    .article-section {
      margin-top: 3rem;
      padding-top: 3rem;
      border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
    }
  
    .article-section h2 {
      font-family: var(--font-display);
      font-size: clamp(1.6rem, 4vw, 2.2rem);
      font-weight: 800;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.03em;
      color: var(--text);
      margin-bottom: 1rem;
      margin-top: 2.5rem;
      padding-top: 2rem;
      border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
    }
  
    .article-section h2:first-child { margin-top: 0; padding-top: 0; border-top: none; }
  
    .article-section h3 {
      font-family: var(--font-display);
      font-size: 1.2rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.04em;
      color: var(--accent);
      margin: 1.5rem 0 0.6rem;
    }
  
    .article-section p {
      font-size: 0.95rem;
      color: var(--text-mid);
      line-height: 1.75;
      margin-bottom: 1rem;
    }
  
    .article-section p strong { color: var(--text); }
    .article-section a { color: var(--accent); text-decoration: none; }
    .article-section a:hover { text-decoration: underline; }
  
    .data-table {
      width: 100%;
      border-collapse: collapse;
      margin: 1.25rem 0 1.75rem;
      font-size: 0.85rem;
      border-radius: 12px;
      overflow: hidden;
    }
  
    .data-table thead { background: var(--surface2); }
  
    .data-table th {
      font-family: var(--font-mono);
      font-size: 0.6rem;
      letter-spacing: 0.12em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: var(--text-muted);
      padding: 0.75rem 1rem;
      text-align: left;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
    }
  
    .data-table td {
      padding: 0.75rem 1rem;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
      color: var(--text-mid);
      background: var(--surface);
    }
  
    .data-table tr:last-child td { border-bottom: none; }
    .data-table td:first-child { color: var(--text); font-weight: 500; }
    .data-table .highlight td { background: rgba(170,255,0,0.07); }
    .data-table .highlight td:first-child { color: var(--accent); }
  
    /* ── FAQ ── */
    .faq-item { border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); padding: 1.25rem 0; }
    .faq-item:last-child { border-bottom: none; }
  
    .faq-q {
      font-family: var(--font-display);
      font-size: 1.1rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.03em;
      color: var(--text);
      margin-bottom: 0.6rem;
    }
  
    .faq-a { font-size: 0.9rem; color: var(--text-mid); line-height: 1.7; }
    .faq-a a { color: var(--accent); }
    .format-tab { cursor: pointer; }
    .form-error { font-size: 0.85rem; color: var(--red); margin: 0.75rem 0 0; min-height: 1em; }
    .orm-label { font-family: var(--font-mono, monospace); font-size: 0.7rem; letter-spacing: 0.14em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--text-muted); text-align: center; margin: 0 0 0.25rem; }
    .orm-big { font-family: var(--font-display, sans-serif); font-weight: 900; font-size: 4.5rem; line-height: 1; color: var(--accent); text-align: center; margin-bottom: 1.25rem; }
    .pct-table td:nth-child(2) { color: var(--text); font-weight: 600; }
    .pct-table th, .pct-table td { white-space: nowrap; }
    @media (max-width: 560px) { .pct-table th:nth-child(4), .pct-table td:nth-child(4) { display: none; } }
    #level-card .bar-label { min-width: 7.5rem; }
    #level-card .bar-val { white-space: nowrap; min-width: 5.5rem; text-align: right; }
  </style>
disclaimer:
  - "Estimates only. Strength levels are approximate targets for athletes, not competition standards."
  - "Max testing should be supervised, with a spotter or safety bars. Not medical advice."
jsonld: |-
  <script type="application/ld+json">
  {
    "@context": "https://schema.org",
    "@type": "WebApplication",
    "name": "1 Rep Max Calculator",
    "description": "Free one-rep max calculator for squat, bench press, deadlift and power clean. Averages the Epley, Brzycki and Lombardi formulas, gives a training percentage chart and a strength level by bodyweight.",
    "url": "https://athletecalculator.com/one-rep-max-calculator",
    "applicationCategory": "HealthApplication",
    "operatingSystem": "Web",
    "offers": {
      "@type": "Offer",
      "price": "0",
      "priceCurrency": "USD"
    },
    "creator": {
      "@type": "Organization",
      "name": "Athlete Calculator"
    }
  }
  </script>
  <script type="application/ld+json">
  {
    "@context": "https://schema.org",
    "@type": "FAQPage",
    "mainEntity": [
      {
        "@type": "Question",
        "name": "How do you calculate your one rep max?",
        "acceptedAnswer": {
          "@type": "Answer",
          "text": "Lift a weight you can handle for 2 to 10 good reps, then plug the weight and reps into a formula. The Epley formula is weight × (1 + reps ÷ 30), so 225 pounds for 5 reps estimates a 1RM of about 263 pounds. This calculator averages the Epley, Brzycki and Lombardi formulas."
        }
      },
      {
        "@type": "Question",
        "name": "How accurate are 1RM calculators?",
        "acceptedAnswer": {
          "@type": "Answer",
          "text": "From a hard set of 10 reps or fewer, estimates usually land within about 5% of a true max. Accuracy drops at higher reps because muscular endurance varies a lot between people. The closer your set is to 1 to 5 reps, the better the estimate."
        }
      },
      {
        "@type": "Question",
        "name": "What is a good bench press for my bodyweight?",
        "acceptedAnswer": {
          "@type": "Answer",
          "text": "For male athletes, benching about 1.0 times bodyweight is a solid college-athlete level, and 1.4 times bodyweight is strong. For female athletes, about 0.65 times bodyweight is a solid college-athlete level and 0.9 times is strong."
        }
      },
      {
        "@type": "Question",
        "name": "What percentage of my 1RM should I train at?",
        "acceptedAnswer": {
          "@type": "Answer",
          "text": "For maximal strength, work at 85 to 95 percent for 1 to 5 reps. For building muscle, 70 to 85 percent for 6 to 12 reps. For speed and power, 30 to 60 percent moved as fast as possible."
        }
      },
      {
        "@type": "Question",
        "name": "How often should you test your 1 rep max?",
        "acceptedAnswer": {
          "@type": "Answer",
          "text": "Most athletes test or re-estimate every 6 to 12 weeks, usually at the end of a training block. Re-estimating from a heavy set of 3 to 5 reps works just as well for updating training percentages."
        }
      }
    ]
  }
  </script>
  <script type="application/ld+json">
  {
    "@context": "https://schema.org",
    "@type": "BreadcrumbList",
    "itemListElement": [
      {
        "@type": "ListItem",
        "position": 1,
        "name": "Home",
        "item": "https://athletecalculator.com"
      },
      {
        "@type": "ListItem",
        "position": 2,
        "name": "Strength & Power",
        "item": "https://athletecalculator.com/strength-power"
      },
      {
        "@type": "ListItem",
        "position": 3,
        "name": "1 Rep Max Calculator",
        "item": "https://athletecalculator.com/one-rep-max-calculator"
      }
    ]
  }
  </script>
---
<header>
<p class="eyebrow">Free Strength Tool</p>
<h1>1 Rep Max<span>Calculator</span></h1>
<p class="subtitle">Enter a weight and how many reps you did to estimate your one-rep max. You'll also get a training percentage chart and your strength level relative to bodyweight.</p>
</header><div class="container">
<div class="links-row">
<a class="site-link" href="/squat-strength-calculator">
      ↑ <strong>Squat Strength</strong> to Vertical &amp; Speed
    </a>
<a class="site-link" href="/strength-power">
      ↑ <strong>Strength &amp; Power</strong> Hub
    </a>
</div>
<div class="card">
<p class="card-label">Your Set</p>
<div class="format-tabs" role="group" aria-label="Units">
<button class="format-tab active" type="button" onclick="setUnit('lb', this)">Pounds (lb)</button>
<button class="format-tab" type="button" onclick="setUnit('kg', this)">Kilograms (kg)</button>
</div>
<div class="form-grid">
<div class="field">
<label for="lift">Lift</label>
<select id="lift">
<option value="squat">Back Squat</option>
<option value="bench">Bench Press</option>
<option value="deadlift">Deadlift</option>
<option value="clean">Power Clean</option>
</select>
</div>
<div class="field">
<label for="sex">Sex</label>
<select id="sex">
<option value="m">Male</option>
<option value="f">Female</option>
</select>
</div>
<div class="field">
<label for="w">Weight Lifted (<span class="unit-lbl">lb</span>)</label>
<input id="w" max="1500" min="1" placeholder="e.g. 225" step="0.5" type="number" inputmode="decimal"/>
</div>
<div class="field">
<label for="reps">Reps Completed</label>
<input id="reps" max="15" min="1" placeholder="1–15" step="1" type="number" inputmode="numeric"/>
</div>
<div class="field full">
<label for="bw">Bodyweight (<span class="unit-lbl">lb</span>, optional, for strength level)</label>
<input id="bw" max="500" min="60" placeholder="e.g. 185" step="0.5" type="number" inputmode="decimal"/>
</div>
</div>
<p class="form-error" id="form-error" role="alert"></p>
<button class="calc-btn" type="button" onclick="calculate()">Estimate My 1RM →</button>
</div>
<div id="results">
<div class="gauge-card anim anim-d1">
<p class="orm-label">Estimated 1 Rep Max</p>
<div class="orm-big" id="orm-big">—</div>
